    "detailed_description": "TRAFFIC is a fictional story inspired by my own personal experiences, various news articles, statistics, and national incidents that remain unexplained. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091510/extras/0a56b1cda9160d9e0cf344904b6244a7.avif?t=1690901694\" /></div><br><strong>TRAFFIC is a First-Person Psychological Horror game about a troubled child in a home where he must deal with both internal and external stresses.</strong> You will communicate with your parents, do your chores, and stay out of the way. <br><br>Secure the front gate and lock your doors. You never know who might be out there. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091510/extras/8a4f85a7db485350785416c128b5f8cb.avif?t=1690901694\" /></div><br>TRAFFIC is about a family living in Wyoming as they traverse through the economic recession of 2008. <strong>You play as the single child in a family of three, along with your Mother and Father. </strong><br><br>Experience the gut-wrenching tension and horrifying story of TRAFFIC as you make your way through the days, doing whatever you can to take your mind off of the traumatic events occurring.  <br><br>Piece the story together as you notice tiny details within the dialogue and environments. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091510/extras/842eda5892a61898b0f53d04617b3fd5.avif?t=1690901694\" /></div> <br><br>Huge thanks to Unrested / Inksmith for creating the Art of 'Mother' used in this game. You can check him out on YouTube @Unrested or at @Inksmith<br><br>Huge thanks to Bazookya for creating an entire TV show segment. You can check him out on Twitch @ Bazookya <br><br>Huge thanks to Monk for taking my terrible MIDI music and producing it into something useful and awesome.<br><br>Unreal Retro Shaders / DaveFace <br><br>Rest of credits in game <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2091510/extras/33bdc3b2b50bb97a2dc5ebe040bf1d63.avif?t=1690901694\" /></div><br><strong>This game contains subject matter not suitable for those susceptible to the following themes:</strong><br><br><strong>Implications of Domestic Abuse<br>Implications of Suicide<br>Gore<br>Sleep Paralysis<br>Home Invasions</strong>",
